# Mozartkugel-Verkaeufer: street vendor in 18th-century Mozart costume.
# White wig w/i with side rolls and a d ribbon on the queue, teal coat t/T,
# white jabot, white stockings, buckle shoes. Prop: wooden belly tray
# (Bauchladen) o/O/l with three wrapped Mozartkugeln (silver w/i, red r/R
# band = the only red, well under 10 %). Throws unwrapped chocolate (O/l).
# Faces right; mirror = auto. windup = arm high with a ball (telegraph).
sprite = mozartkugel_verkaeufer
size   = 16x24
origin = 8,24
hitbox = 2,2,12,22
mirror = auto
anim   = idle     frames=2 ticks=30 loop
anim   = windup   frames=1
anim   = throw    frames=1
anim   = squished frames=1
